{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneGauge","lean:module:QOU.Mass.KohnoAssembly"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ.lagrangian_gauge_to_KZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ.lagrangian_gauge_to_KZ","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BridgeADeligneKZ.lean#L50-L80","doc":"**Bridge A, route B, for `𝔤𝔩_2` fundamental.** A connection on `V^{⊗(m+1)}` whose monodromy\nis the Jimbo braiding is algebraically gauge equivalent to KZ (shifted by `c`), given Deligne full\nfaithfulness. The gauge `g` is an invertible matrix over the algebraic ring `R`, with\n`∂_j g = ω_L j · g − g · ω_KZ j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ.closure_range_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BridgeADeligneKZ.closure_range_σ","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/BridgeADeligneKZ.lean#L46-L48","doc":"The Artin generators generate the braid group. ","signatureChunk":0}]}